# Architecture

```
VORQEN/
  apps/web/          # Next.js only (UI + API)
  packages/ui|types|config/
  prisma/
  docs/
```

## App (`apps/web`)

- **UI:** App Router groups `(store)`, `(account)`, `(auth)`, `admin/`
- **Features:** `src/features/<domain>/`
- **Server domains:** `src/server/<domain>/` — services hold business logic
- **GraphQL:** Route Handler at `/api/graphql` (Yoga) — thin resolvers → services
- **Webhooks/cron:** `/api/webhooks/*`, `/api/cron/*`
- Zustand = UI state only; prices/stock/compat/auth = server

## Data

- PostgreSQL + Prisma
- Typed hardware fields for compatibility-critical specs

Full: `docs/architecture.md`.
